FlashRWKV

This repository began from MoonshotAI/FlashKDA, distributed under the MIT
License. The original KDA operator, Python package, CUDA data-plane, tests,
and benchmarks have been removed. The repository history and remaining
general project material retain the MoonshotAI copyright and MIT notice.

The following files contain material adapted from the vLLM project and its
RWKV/Albatross integration at rwkv-rs/vllm-rwkv commit
6d683f9e49a2997e405c47edc147872c8609513b:

- csrc/bindings.cpp
- csrc/recurrent/recurrent_fp32.cu
- csrc/recurrent/recurrent_fp16.cu
- benchmarks/benchmark_recurrent.py
- benchmarks/benchmark_rwkv7.py

The following file contains a checkpoint/backstepping method adapted from
BlinkDL/RWKV-LM commit 952102498e9ed367ea0a59ee64106916d474d30f:

- csrc/chunk/backward_fp32.cu

Those derived files are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 and
retain SPDX/source-revision headers. See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The FLA chunk_rwkv7 implementation is used only as an external correctness
and benchmark dependency. No FLA implementation source is bundled here.

All other original FlashRWKV work is licensed under the repository's MIT
license unless a file states otherwise.
